OL,3,AYemen's Houthis seize strategic Red Sea
OL,4,Aport of Mokha
OL,5,
OL,6,FYemen's Houthis have seized the
OL,7,Fstrategic Red Sea port city of Mokha
OL,8,Ffrom Saudi-backed pro-government
OL,9,Fforces, military sources and witnesses
OL,10,Fsay.
OL,12,FThe Iran-backed group said they posed
OL,13,Fno threat to international shipping but
OL,14,Freiterated that they would target
OL,15,Fvessels from Saudi Arabia, which has
OL,16,Frelied on the Red Sea for oil exports
OL,17,Fsince the US and Israel's war with Iran
OL,18,Feffectively closed the Strait of Hormuz
OL,19,Fin the Gulf.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
