OL,3,AYemen's Houthis seize strategic Red Sea
OL,4,Aport of Mokha
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Friday, pro-government forces also
OL,7,Fwithdrew from Perim island in the Bab
OL,8,Fal-Mandab Strait, according to
OL,9,Fofficials. Witnesses reported that
OL,10,FHouthi forces moved onto the island.
OL,12,FThe strait is the southern gateway to a
OL,13,Fkey shipping route that links Asia and
OL,14,FEurope via the Red Sea and Suez canal.
